# Judge1-3-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:请大家<br>回想一下<br>诺亚尸体的<br>状况……|#0101Trial03_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-4 Scale:1.5 TintColor:#808080 Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,60 AppearanceAndTransition:270_2
@PrintDebateText Text:现场是一幅<br>纯白色的画布，<br>而她尸体的摆放位置<br>仿佛在诉说，她就是那只蝴蝶。|#0101Trial03_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,35 Roll:-4

@PrintDebateText Text:她将自己的身体<br>用作她最终作品的<br>画具……<br>这样子想是不是就说得通了呢？|#0101Trial03_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,35 Roll:-4

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL1,Option-ArmL-Off
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这……<br>真的说得通吗？|#0101Trial03_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……内心疲惫不堪的<br>天才艺术家诺亚，<br>选择拿起凶器<br>刺穿自己的心脏。|#0101Trial03_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:0

; ＠備考◆恍惚
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR7,ArmL3
@PrintDebateText Text:接着，<br>从伤口处喷出了血液，<br>将事先涂满颜料的房间<br>染成一片通红……|#0101Trial03_Margo005| RevealSpeed:1

; 恍惚
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@PrintDebateText Text:然后诺亚她<br>完成了<br>一幅绘画。<br>那就是她人生<br>最后的遗作……|#0101Trial03_Margo006| RevealSpeed:1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR7,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@PrintDebateText Text:"多么美丽的<link=\"Objection_01_01_03_01\">自杀</link>。<br>这么想的话，<br>一切都说得通了。|#0101Trial03_Margo007|" RevealSpeed:1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@PrintDebateText Text:"那<link=\"Objection_01_01_03_02\">房间内的状况</link>，<br>也全都是诺亚她亲手制作的<br>艺术作品的一部分哦。|#0101Trial03_Margo008|" RevealSpeed:1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……等一下。<br>疑似凶器的<br>那个【箭矢】<br>掉落在诺亚的尸体附近。|#0101Trial03_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@PrintDebateText Text:按常理想，<br>不是她自己刺伤自己，<br>而是被人【射中】了，<br>这样想才更自然，不是吗？|#0101Trial03_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:哎呀，那可说不定哦？|#0101Trial03_Margo009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:40,45 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_01_03_03\">亲手刺伤自己</link>这么简单的事，<br>她当然能做到啊。<br>还是说，<br>你有<link=\"Objection_01_01_03_04\">证据</link><br>能否定这个主张吗？|#0101Trial03_Margo010|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,40 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……我觉得，<br>过着这样的监狱生活，<br>思考变得不太正常<br>也无可厚非。|#0101Trial03_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果她的内心<br>已经崩溃了……<br>很难说<br>一切完全没可能……|#0101Trial03_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:0

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

