[PrintTextModified Text:"（诺亚究竟是怎么死的呢……<br>　她还有很多事情<br>　我们根本都不清楚……）|#0101Trial03_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@GosubToSplitPerspectiveStageScreens Index:1 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
[PrintTextModified Text:……艾玛小姐，你听我讲。<br>我们目前知道的事是有限的。<br>不知道的事情就是不知道，这是理所当然的。|#0101Trial03_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Smile_Closed1
[PrintTextModified Text:那么，我想……我们应该讨论的是<br>【现在已经知道的事情】才对。|#0101Trial03_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……！你说得对！|#0101Trial03_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true Wait:true
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……重新确认一下，<br>　魔女图鉴的情报和玛格的发言<br>　有没有出入吧……！）|#0101Trial03_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@GotoModified Path:.Judge1-3-1

